@host = http://localhost:5080
@clinicId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@professionalId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@patientId = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333
@appointmentTypeId = 44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444

# Conveniência de desenvolvimento (ADR-0010): identidade sem login, aceita apenas em DEV/TEST.
# Alternativa recomendada: autenticar por /auth/login e usar o cookie de sessão.
@actorId = recepcao-dev
@actorName = Recepcao (desenvolvimento)
@gestorEmail = gestor@canamed.local
@gestorPassword = defina-no-arquivo-env

### Liveness — deve responder 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness — 200 com banco acessível, 503 com Problem Details quando indisponível
GET {{host}}/api/v1/health/ready
Accept: application/problem+json

### Rota inexistente — deve responder 404 em Problem Details (RFC 7807)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/rota-inexistente

### Login (F-001) — grava o cookie de sessão; use as variáveis do .env para e-mail e senha
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Canamed-Requested-With: canamed-spa

{
  "email": "{{gestorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{gestorPassword}}"
}

### Concluir login com o segundo fator (F-002), quando a resposta anterior indicar mfaRequired
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login/mfa
Content-Type: application/json
X-Canamed-Requested-With: canamed-spa

{
  "challengeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "code": "000000"
}

### Sessão atual (usuário, clínica ativa, papel e permissões)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/session
X-Canamed-Requested-With: canamed-spa

### Usuários da clínica (gestor com MFA concluído)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users
X-Canamed-Requested-With: canamed-spa

### Logout (F-004)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/logout
X-Canamed-Requested-With: canamed-spa

### Agenda do dia (F-004)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/appointments?date=2026-10-05&professionalId={{professionalId}}
Accept: application/json
X-Canamed-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Canamed-Actor-Name: {{actorName}}
X-Canamed-Clinic-Id: {{clinicId}}

### Criar agendamento (F-001) — 409 se houver sobreposição ou bloqueio
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Canamed-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Canamed-Actor-Name: {{actorName}}
X-Canamed-Clinic-Id: {{clinicId}}

{
  "professionalId": "{{professionalId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "appointmentTypeId": "{{appointmentTypeId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-10-05T14:00:00-03:00"
}

### Remarcar (F-002)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/reschedule
Content-Type: application/json
X-Canamed-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Canamed-Clinic-Id: {{clinicId}}

{ "startsAt": "2026-10-05T16:00:00-03:00" }

### Cancelar com motivo obrigatório (F-003)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-Canamed-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Canamed-Clinic-Id: {{clinicId}}

{ "reason": "Paciente solicitou por telefone" }

### Bloquear intervalo da agenda (RN-011)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/professionals/{{professionalId}}/blocks
Content-Type: application/json
X-Canamed-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Canamed-Clinic-Id: {{clinicId}}

{
  "startsAt": "2026-10-05T08:00:00-03:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-10-05T09:00:00-03:00",
  "reason": "Reunião clínica"
}

### Cadastro mínimo necessário para agendar
GET {{host}}/api/v1/professionals
X-Canamed-Clinic-Id: {{clinicId}}

### Sem permissão de escrita — deve responder 403 permission-denied
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Canamed-Clinic-Id: {{clinicId}}
X-Canamed-Permissions: agenda:read

{
  "professionalId": "{{professionalId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "appointmentTypeId": "{{appointmentTypeId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-10-05T15:00:00-03:00"
}
